OL,3,AEverton striker's relief family not
OL,4,Ahome during burglary
OL,5,
OL,6,FEverton striker Thierno Barry has said
OL,7,Fhe was relieved that his family were
OL,8,Fnot at home when it was burgled while
OL,9,Fhe played in a cup match.
OL,11,FHis home in Greater Manchester was
OL,12,Ftargeted while he was playing for
OL,13,FEverton against Newcastle United in a
OL,14,FCarabao Cup tie at the Hill Dickinson
OL,15,Fstadium on Thursday.
OL,17,FThe Frenchman, 24, posted on Instagram
OL,18,F"things could have been much worse" had
OL,19,Fhis partner and toddler not been in the
OL,20,Fstands.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
